                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e7d7e322-a2bb-47bc-8e44-261c4472067a" type="punctum" xml:id="m-d42549ee-781b-4306-9606-95802649baff">
                  <nc xml:id="m-1b08bb0d-3583-4129-86ee-be53f8c99330" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-98302aa4-72e5-4913-b3f2-6fe9bfdbda08">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-c8ec20cc-a058-4e11-95e7-d227aef0e95e" type="punctum" xml:id="m-8b827146-4416-4971-9068-4f5c80c3313b">
                  <nc xml:id="m-640c620c-1264-445d-ba0f-db4235a25249" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-71c6f099-90cd-4e3f-ad4d-5ec2363d4002">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-ecc86041-ef4c-4448-a590-3b2a485026f4" type="punctum" xml:id="m-39742164-4411-4b43-b9fa-203cc68bbe70">
                  <nc xml:id="m-5c710214-cd89-4e4b-b75e-0d53f6d26701" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-a07dd6ca-13fc-41e5-968b-dc0c997a3446" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-d6e1af9b-9857-4c45-beca-3a55941c8feb" facs="#m-9fff46da-7e8d-44ca-b80e-8921a20c0d94" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-c0dc749f-23b7-4f8e-abcc-901a5f56ff44">
            <lg xml:id="m-8f790818-c920-40da-8f61-a73860e93a3c">
              <l xml:id="m-5843c355-1dc9-41d4-8020-ed44beac1af0" facs="#m-90ea463c-47c5-4d78-8a76-0f2844943467" label="ambiguous">1350</l><l xml:id="m-5f89c73c-db6a-40e5-aa8f-8933b30a3621" facs="#m-fc2000f2-d8d5-4d67-8956-5aed9e00a19e" label="ambiguous">JIanuary 26.</l><l xml:id="m-8773c930-8c16-468a-9d8a-976e7605ce6f" facs="#m-d0cde372-bfcf-4014-9e5f-6815a7c5e07a" label="lyrics-like">me-rí-di-em cérnat fides, Et só-lis instar só-la régnet cá¬</l><l xml:id="m-984964d5-ec54-473b-accb-5c51d580caf8" facs="#m-32cbef65-3e09-494c-8186-5fc88d2bbd4c" label="lyrics-like">ri-tas. 2. Sit Tri-ni- tá-ti sempi-térna gló-ri-a, Hónor,</l><l xml:id="m-1f1ef18e-31a7-424f-8a95-2e930c0f34ae" facs="#m-bbb5be40-3963-4455-b3c6-e96ca4ee5a9d" label="lyrics-like">pot-éstas, atque ju-bi- la-ti-o, In uni- tá-te quae gubér¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e47c079-0fdd-4cff-8205-35e49426309f" facs="#m-fa515014-15ce-4de0-85cb-304e76c21a77" label="lyrics-like">nat ómni-a, Per univér-sa aeterni-tá-tis saécu-la. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-c607d751-2de2-4aa4-a2fb-3632f37253e9" facs="#m-ceaf7d5f-9bcb-4864-8c13-0dfef8f8bbc9" label="lyrics-like">v. Tu es vas electiónis sáncte Páule Apóstole.</l><l xml:id="m-1fd4d0b0-116b-424b-ae26-2b936e837207" facs="#m-b3ebdec7-4253-4154-959b-e1b0cfb7e7a4" label="lyrics-like">R. Praedicátor veritátis in univérso múndo.</l><l xml:id="m-7501279b-bc51-4b34-899e-e6a5282710a2" facs="#m-dd38ad82-6ebb-4325-8542-bdb8782f48bf" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-d717fd5e-f4d7-4a99-a2ea-d57b9a56aef7" facs="#m-4bc0b836-f7ad-4964-9908-86c0b660c3af" label="ambiguous">Ant. S.G</l><l xml:id="m-44c9f72d-d330-4cf5-bd64-4c51c693936b" facs="#m-22c1a4a6-fd07-4424-9365-d9fbfefac16f" label="lyrics-like">Ancte Páule Apósto-le, “praedi-cá-tor ve-ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-20a180dc-5fcc-419c-b98e-a5fd38107753" facs="#m-edd9149c-93a9-4905-b283-c5e2404f87bd" label="lyrics-like">tá-tis, et Dóctor génti-um: intercéde pro nóbis ad Dé-um,</l><l xml:id="m-dc3ee4da-894a-4523-84ed-1902ba0d8ba6" facs="#m-ad4b73e0-3579-4625-b5b5-9de112cea77e" label="lyrics-like">qui te e-lé-git. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-3b9cf014-104a-4d05-bea6-b2469bc1b1d9" facs="#m-c1d07666-5bc7-4e57-abf8-0cf4a16baf86" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212.</l><l xml:id="m-86a30071-9832-43cf-b038-ec986a4da2a0" facs="#m-35601a2a-4a75-4b17-b095-255f9208f5bc" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui univérsum. D. 1344.</l><l xml:id="m-18cc61ff-5f1f-40b4-a4ee-c081d1c7309e" facs="#m-ff400b2e-3077-4118-bc29-cf9acff5c037" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration or St. Peter. Ant. Tu es Pástor. p. 1880. Y. Tu es Pétrus.</l><l xml:id="m-5e5ccff9-da39-474d-b144-025d0f5a49b9" facs="#m-cf11e6d2-1cf5-4ca2-8bf0-04921c5ba036" label="text-like">.1830. Prayer. Deus, qui beato Petro. p. 1331.</l><l xml:id="m-10a078e2-c985-4277-a6ae-81c09cf9e638" facs="#m-d83c9f75-a0f5-4042-aaf5-57e6cfd80048" label="text-like">St. Polycarp, Bishop and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-75c4b26c-d2ad-4b9b-8dc3-604ee386b67b" facs="#m-31adedc7-bfc5-408a-9d91-fcd7e380cbd5" label="ambiguous">26.</l><l xml:id="m-296f8612-4095-4044-8db3-8c279f421046" facs="#m-ba3d4b82-a580-43ac-b341-97fdcc21f464" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-ac246980-8858-4a14-81de-2c56ea09c4b6" facs="#m-e7f96a4e-3296-48d6-a36a-0245f8bf51c7" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Sacerdótes Déi. p. 1132, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-8f43574e-f5ed-427e-a9bc-f080583920ee" facs="#m-967bb140-018e-4cc8-bd16-18f519c07918" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-1f4b5403-5c91-43a8-9062-172631b9c8e6" facs="#m-b6358120-9af5-4f33-af97-5bbde3676a47" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos beáti Polycárpi litia cólimus, * de ejúsdem étiam</l><l xml:id="m-7464eadb-780d-43cf-9137-6a36474d448f" facs="#m-5111d43c-cf3e-4a68-9f64-3695a4bc7784" label="lyrics-like">U Mártyris tui atque Pontificis</l><l xml:id="m-75bfae8c-a431-44b1-a1ae-ae6eeec4e79a" facs="#m-36f44aad-48ee-4423-a87f-d6d3548a02fa" label="lyrics-like">protectióne gaudeámus. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-176c266b-4ea6-4c78-a2c1-192bfabde32c" facs="#m-d6b9bd22-276c-4e82-8db9-b4bd492c251d" label="lyrics-like">ánnua solemnitáte laetíficas:</l><l xml:id="m-bda793f4-dfdb-4cda-bfb2-f87bf0ad9a58" facs="#m-61efab30-a59a-4b9e-b556-cdce2ef7e1dc" label="ambiguous">num nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-b5b69dc0-7215-4e9f-8ab4-aedc801a577c" facs="#m-baeb0ba8-e8f0-4e6d-93ea-ecd17381d9e7" label="lyrics-like">concéde propitius: ut cujus nata¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
